{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of the Wilds is a simplistic third-person dungeon crawler with RPG turn-based combat. Control a small party of animals as they transport an important religious relic through hostile, war-torn territory. Customize your party, collect equipment, and vanquish foes as you progress through labyrinthine, procedurally generated wilderness expanses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat system, with unique status effects, damage types, and equipment bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory to give each animal the equipment and items that guarantee its success in battle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are randomly generated, with different enemy and chest positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of weapons, each with their own abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has unique stats and abilities and can be freely swapped into your party at any time.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689620?t=1749623874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689620?t=1749623874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689620/e33c8942d216daf92e5c67b15e70539fb50aa497/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749623874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689620/e33c8942d216daf92e5c67b15e70539fb50aa497/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749623874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of the Wilds is a simplistic third-person dungeon crawler with RPG turn-based combat. Control a small party of animals as they transport an important religious relic through hostile, war-torn territory. Customize your party, collect equipment, and vanquish foes as you progress through labyrinthine, procedurally generated wilderness expanses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat system, with unique status effects, damage types, and equipment bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory to give each animal the equipment and items that guarantee its success in battle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are randomly generated, with different enemy and chest positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of weapons, each with their own abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has unique stats and abilities and can be freely swapped into your party at any time.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Aidan Sterling, Anna Schultz, Stephen Francoeur, Chad Blanco-Rios, Hung Nguyen, Haorong Rong, Ethan Hernandez, Louis Loduha, Sky Stadler"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689620/c42faa9006b73bb6ea4a460fec2c6aeb2f86f44c/header.jpg?t=1749623874","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3689620/666294886/e789303de15b4ec5c21eb93fe5181a6b5917cdc4/1750403753/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747076734","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3689620/666294886/e789303de15b4ec5c21eb93fe5181a6b5917cdc4/17504037